201 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/T (Mazi Saheli Charitable Trust \(MSCT\) envisions a future where rural communities in India flourish with resilience, self-sufficiency, and shared prosperity. We believe that every individual, irrespective of their background, should have equitable access to education, healthcare, and opportunities that enable personal and collective growth. Guided by this vision, MSCT is committed to fostering an inclusive and sustainable environment where rural populations are not only beneficiaries of development but also active participants in shaping their future. We aim to be a catalyst for transformative change, promoting community-driven progress, gender equality, and social empowerment. Through relentless dedication, strategic interventions, and an unwavering belief in the potential of rural India, MSCT aspires to contribute to a future where these communities emerge as models of sustainable development, resilience, and inclusive growth. Together, we are working toward a brighter, more equitable tomorrow for rural India.)
/E (Mazi Saheli Charitable Trust \(MSCT\) envisions a future where rural communities in India flourish with resilience, self-sufficiency, and shared prosperity. We believe that every individual, irrespective of their background, should have equitable access to education, healthcare, and opportunities that enable personal and collective growth. Guided by this vision, MSCT is committed to fostering an inclusive and sustainable environment where rural populations are not only beneficiaries of development but also active participants in shaping their future. We aim to be a catalyst for transformative change, promoting community-driven progress, gender equality, and social empowerment. Through relentless dedication, strategic interventions, and an unwavering belief in the potential of rural India, MSCT aspires to contribute to a future where these communities emerge as models of sustainable development, resilience, and inclusive growth. Together, we are working toward a brighter, more equitable tomorrow for rural India.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [0 1 2]
>>
